##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A plastic floor and wall and a grey sphere under a rect light, rendered at four samples a pixel and denoised
version 3.03
Format 48 32 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -20 1 0 0
Option "moya" "int denoise" [1]
Display "compositing-denoise.exr" "openexr" "rgba"
WorldBegin
TransformBegin
Translate 0 1.4 0
Rotate 90 1 0 0
Light "PxrRectLight" "panel" "float intensity" [12]
TransformEnd
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "floor" "color base_color" [0.6 0.6 0.6] "float specular_roughness" [0.4]
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 -2  2 -1 -2  2 -1 2  -2 -1 2]
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 2  2 -1 2  2 1.5 2  -2 1.5 2]
AttributeBegin
Translate 0 -0.6 0.2
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "grey" "color base_color" [0.5 0.5 0.5] "float specular_roughness" [0.3]
Sphere 0.4 -0.4 0.4 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
